tkInterFit is maintained by Ross Moffett (findcurves@gmail.com).

1.2.0 (November 2026)
  - Added the 2D and 3D Function Finder, based on the zunzunsite3 function
    finder, with a ranked results window and a single PDF of all results

1.1.0 (November 2026)
  - Updated for Python 3.14 and current numpy, scipy, matplotlib and reportlab
  - Added a Windows executable and installer

Earlier versions were written by James R. Phillips. Their change log can
be viewed at:

https://bitbucket.org/zunzuncode/tkInterFit/commits/all
